ags": {}, "id": 128, "type": "CLIPLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors", "directory": "text_encoders", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## Model Links\n[🤗 Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   ├── minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 text_encoders/\n│       └── qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Model Links", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [440, 740], "pos": [-2500, 4850], "id": 117, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## MiniMax H3\n\n[MiniMax H3](https://www.minimax.io/blog/minimax-h3) is MiniMax's general-purpose, omni-modal generation model. It jointly understands text, image, video, and audio, and generates video with **native stereo audio**: voice, sound effects, and music are modeled jointly in a single forward pass, not layered on afterward. Output is up to 2K resolution, 24fps, and up to about 15 seconds.\n\n## ComfyUI links\n- [ComfyUI#15224](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/15224)\n- [🤗 Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n\n## About this workflow\n\nThis template runs the **reference-to-video (ref2va)** task using the `MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` node. It takes any mix of reference images, videos, and standalone audio, and weaves them into the generation to lock in a character's identity, a style, a motion, a camera move, or a voice.\n\n**Key inputs**\n\n- **ref_images / ref_videos / ref_video_audios / ref_audios**: up to 9 reference images, 3 reference videos (each may carry its own paired soundtrack), and 3 standalone reference audio clips\n- **prompt**: reference the inputs by tag, in the exact order they were connected, for example `<Picture 1>`, `<Video 1>`, `<Audio 1>`, then describe the target scene, motion, and audio\n- **ref_image_size**: `match` scales references down to the generation's resolution (faster); `max` keeps up to a 2048px short edge for stronger identity fidelity, at the cost of speed since reference tokens ride along every sampling step\n- **width / height**: set via Resolution Selector.\n- **duration (seconds)**: converted to a valid frame `length` by the Math Expression node\n\n**Sampling and decode**\n\n- Sampler: `res_multistep`. `beta` or `normal` scheduler tends to outperform `simple` for reference-heavy prompts like this one\n- The sampler's joint audio+video `LATENT` output feeds directly into both `VAEDecode` (video, `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16`) and `VAEDecodeAudio` (audio, `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32`); each decode node automatically pulls its own half out of the packed latent. `CreateVideo` then muxes the two into a single MP4 with synced sound\n- The diffusion model here is `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`, a different set of weights from the `fl2va` model used by the t2v/i2v templates\n\nRef2va's output is very sensitive to prompt wording; matching the reference tags precisely and being explicit about which reference drives which part of the shot tends to work best."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax H3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [450, 889.6875], "pos": [-2498.9912109375, 5646.3759765625], "id": 116, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [261], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [15], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "时间（秒）", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [270, 70], "pos": [-1956.4134521484375, 5134.44189453125], "id": 132, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveFloat"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [279], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["使用参考九宫格作为完整的分镜顺序、人物造型和场景参考。按照左上到右下的顺序理解九个镜头，生成一段连续的15秒电影感动画。\n\n九宫格只用于分镜参考，最终视频必须是正常的单画面。不要显示九宫格、白色边框或拼贴画面。\n\n严格保持两位角色的一致性：\n\n角色A：珍珠白色长发、尖精灵耳、紫色眼睛、深蓝色树枝状宝石冠饰、白蓝色幻想礼服、半透明翼状长袖。\n\n角色B：黑色到深蓝色渐变长发、蓝色眼睛、弯曲呆毛、银色星星发饰、红色丝带、黑白蓝幻想服装、蓝色鳞片状腰饰。\n\n两人始终保持参考图中的Q版比例、精致五官、发型、冠饰、服装和高级树脂手办质感。不得互换发型、饰品或服装。\n\n[0s–1.8s]\n超远景建立镜头。巨大的弯月悬挂在夜空，两位少女从画面下方走进古老的星象遗迹。破损石柱与天体仪分布在道路两侧，长发、丝带和透明衣袖被夜风轻轻吹动。摄像机从她们身后低机位缓慢推进，展现遗迹规模。\n\n[1.8s–3.5s]\n硬切至祭坛正面中景。一颗明亮的蓝色星核从天空高速坠落，落在圆形祭坛上方并悬浮旋转。蓝色光柱瞬间照亮遗迹，两位少女同时停下脚步，惊讶地转向星核。镜头快速环绕两人半圈。\n\n[3.5s–4.8s]\n切至白发少女的脸部特写。蓝色星光倒映在她的紫色瞳孔中，她谨慎地向星核伸出右手。镜头短促推近，细小的蓝色光粒从指尖飞过，冠饰宝石逐渐发亮。\n\n[4.8s–6.2s]\n突然硬切至低机位广角。祭坛后方的黑雾猛烈爆发，凝聚成巨大的黑色影兽，紫色眼睛在黑暗中亮起。蓝发少女迅速抓住白发少女的手，将她向后拉开。摄像机随着怪物扑来快速后退，制造强烈的突袭感。\n\n[6.2s–8.0s]\n动作匹配切换至横向高速跟拍。两位少女牵手奔跑在正在崩塌的石桥上，身后影兽快速追赶。石块不断落入深渊，蓝色火花从脚边掠过。人物头发、丝带和透明长袖产生明显的高速摆动，镜头贴近地面横向追踪。\n\n[8.0s–9.7s]\n切至动态战斗广角。蓝发少女松开手，踩过一块飞起的碎石跃向空中，转身挥出一道巨大的蓝色月牙能量斩。镜头跟随她快速旋转。白发少女留在祭坛旁半跪下来，双手在星核周围展开旋转的紫色魔法阵。\n\n[9.7s–11.2s]\n俯拍镜头。两位少女瞬间移动到魔法阵中央，背靠背站立。蓝色与紫色双重魔法阵在脚下逐层展开，周围的黑色触手从四面八方快速收拢。符文依次点亮，能量沿着圆环向两人之间聚集。\n\n[11.2s–13.3s]\n硬切至英雄中景。两位少女同时转身握住彼此的手，蓝紫色能量在交握的手掌间凝聚成耀眼星光，随后猛烈爆发。镜头先快速推进，再被冲击波震退。巨大的蓝紫色星光贯穿影兽，影兽破碎并化作无数发光粒子，强烈边缘光照亮人物轮廓和飘动的长发。\n\n[13.3s–15.0s]\n星光闪白转场至黎明远景。遗迹恢复宁静，修复后的星核漂浮在祭坛上方。两位少女并肩坐在遗迹边缘，双脚轻轻摇晃，看向远处金色日出。白发少女转头看向蓝发少女，两人相视微笑。摄像机缓慢升高并向后拉远，温柔结束。\n\n画面风格：\n高端精致3D Q版手办动画，电影级灯光，银蓝色月夜，蓝紫色魔法粒子，细腻景深，清晰的树脂和半透明材质，稳定流畅的头发、衣袖和服装动态。战斗段落节奏强烈，结尾安静温暖。\n\n镜头要求：\n必须按照九宫格顺序发生明确的镜头切换。使用硬切、动作匹配剪辑、快速推拉、横向跟拍、旋转镜头、俯拍和闪白转场。不要把所有镜头融合成一段缓慢平移，不要全程使用同一种运镜。\n\n声音设计：\n遗迹夜风、星核坠落的清脆能量声、影兽出现时的低沉轰鸣、石桥崩塌声、奔跑脚步声、魔法斩击声、星光爆发的低频冲击声。结尾战斗声消失，只留下柔和风声与空灵音乐。人物不说话。\n\n避免：\n九宫格边框、拼贴画面、文字、字幕、水印、额外角色、重复人物、人物融合、五官变化、服装变化、发型互换、冠饰消失、肢体变形、动作瞬移、写实人体比例、镜头持续缓慢平移。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1981.2587890625, 5316.47802734375], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "or